Z||000000||88 Database Nut||08-18-99||01:48 PM||||Greetings to all.  I am working on a project to document as many 1988 Fieros as possible.<br>So far, I've got 723 cars in the database, and am looking for more.  If you have/had an<br>'88, or know of one somewhere, I would be very grateful if you could provide me with the following info:  VIN of car, factory color, status of car.  All I really need is the VIN, but other info (mods, options, etc) will be happily accepted.  Thanks for your time and any help you can give me. You can mail me for a summary of the database if you want one.<p>Take Care,   John aka '88 Database Nut'
