Z||000019||88 Database Nut||10-15-1999||03:22 PM||||Hi Guys and Gals,<P>As we head into the weekend, I wanted to take a minute to mention this project again and give you an update on it.  We now have 809 cars in the database!  As you head out to the junkyards, please keep me in mind and if you see an '88, if you can get the VIN and a brief description of the car (colors) for me, I'd be very grateful.  Just to refresh memories, this is a project to document as many 1988 Fieros as possible.  I don't need personal info, but will be happy to include it and anything you want to say about your car in the database.  I hope to soon have it<BR>up on my own web site (when I get one), and hopefully have it up on a friends website next week.<P>Thanks for any help y'all can give me, happy hunting!||||reg||7
