Z||000024||Boxdin||10-18-1999||10:41 PM||||I just bought my third Formula. They are;<P>VIN; 1g2pe1194jp207068   A beautiful silver in and out 5 sp with sunroof. 131k literally little old lady miles. used mainly for club racing and some drives. <P>VIN;1g2pe1192jp205786  A white automatic sunroof car with 92k miles. It had run over a rock underneath and I'm now finishing repairing light damage. It 'll be a daily driver. <P>VIN; 1g2pe1198jp217716  I just bought this car, haven't seen it yet. My son checked it out in Cinninati and pronounced it cherry , but has exhaust leak. white exterior with grey interior 62k automatic, sunroof. <P>I don't want to hear any of you guys complaining about lack of  reasonsble Fieros, I found two of these cars on the internet, and in no case, did I spennd over $2200.00 for any one of these cars. They all need things like brakes and TLC, but the work is fun and I love to drive these cars. After being a manual trans only guy for years, I'm now enjoying a automatic Fiero just as a real point and shoot kind of car, great for darting around.   ||||reg||1
